17	// nothing, a boundary source arrives through source_ip or src_ip
18	// interchangeably, and a plain IPv4 address and its IPv4-mapped IPv6 spelling
19	// share one decision and one dotted output form, while a genuine IPv6 source
20	// with the same trailing 32 bits never matches. Dropped lines and blank lines
21	// never renumber later records, an out-of-range line with an invalid
22	// timestamp is still a counted failure with its reason and no event, and a
